DESCRIPTION:Address:\nSociety Clubhouse\nDoors will open at 12:30 PM and p
 resentations will start at 1:00 PM. Feel free to come earlier to grab a dr
 ink from the cafe before we start!\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nEvent Descript
 ion\nPassion Presentations is a monthly event series that provides a platf
 orm for people to share their passions with the world. Each month features
  a unique theme and supports a different charitable organization\, with 50
 % of event profits donated directly to a cause aligned with that month's t
 opic. The event is comprised of a few 5-10 minute presentations\, followed
  by refreshments and mingling in the cafe.\nSeptember's theme is psycholog
 y and we will be donating to Hard Feelings Toronto.\nEach presenter receiv
 es a complimentary drink ticket\, a small gift bag\, and an honorarium as
 …\n\nHosted by Kithship
