SUMMARY:🤝 Fast Friends Toronto | Meet New People & Make New Friends (25
 –45)
DESCRIPTION:Toronto 20's to 50's Singles Social (4000+)\nYou can live in a
  city full of people and still wonder\, “Where do I actually meet new fr
 iends?”\n\nFast Friends makes that first step easy. Meet 15–25 new peo
 ple through relaxed\, guided conversations\, discover shared interests and
  then stay for drinks and board games with the people you click with.\n\n
 ✨ This edition includes our Common Ground Challenge — a simple way to 
 discover people who share your interests\, experiences and personality.\nC
 ome solo. We'll help you get connected.\n\n🎟️ Book Online & Save: [ht
 tps://toro5thsept.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toro5thsept.eventbrite.co.uk)\
 nEarly Bird: CAD $10\nRegular: CAD $15\nAt the Door: CAD $20 cash — to h
 ost Kruttika\nBooking in advance helps us plan the right space and group s
 ize and guarantees your place.\n\n🍻 What to Expect\n7:00 PM – Welcome
  & Drinks\nMeet your host\, Kristabelle\, grab a drink and settle in.\nCom
 ing alone? Most people do! Our host will welcome you\, make introductions 
 and help you feel comfortable.\n\n🤝 7:30 PM – Fast Friends\nMeet a va
 riety of friendly people through short\, guided conversations.\nNo awkward
 ly approaching strangers — we guide the conversations and rotations\, so
  you can simply focus on getting to know people.\n✨ Common Ground Challe
 nge\nA fun\, simple activity designed to help you find people with similar
  interests and experiences and get those “Oh\, me too!” conversations 
 started.\n\n🎲 From 8:30 PM – Board Games & Mingling\nThe hosted round
 s finish\, but the evening doesn't have to.\nStay for drinks\, play some e
 asy social board games with the people you've met\, or simply continue cha
 tting and getting to know your new connections.\n\n❤️ Why People Love 
 Fast Friends\n✔ Meet 15–25 new people in one evening\n✔ No awkwardly
  approaching strangers — we guide the conversations\n✔ Most attendees 
 come solo\n✔ Friendly hosts and a welcoming atmosphere\n✔ Common Groun
 d Challenge to discover shared interests\n✔ Easy board games & socialisi
 ng after the hosted rounds\n✔ Relaxed pub setting\n✔ Friendship-focuse
 d — not a dating event\n\n👥 Who Is This For?\n✔ Ages 25–45\n✔ N
 ew to Toronto or long-time locals\n✔ Solo attendees welcome\n✔ Anyone 
 looking to make new friends and expand their social circle\nWe're not a cl
 osed group — new faces are always welcome\, and you'll never feel like a
 n outsider.\n\n💳 Why We Use Tickets\nYour ticket helps us:\n• Organis
 e the right venue space\n• Support our local hosts\n• Create a safer\,
  more committed group experience\n• Deliver a well-organised evening for
  everyone\n\n🌍 About Fast Friends\nFor over 10 years\, Fast Friends has
  been helping people meet new people and build meaningful friendships in 3
 0+ cities around the world.\n\nOur mission is simple:\nTo make meeting new
  people easy\, relaxed and enjoyable.\nCome solo. Start with one conversat
 ion. Leave with new friends. ❤️
