SUMMARY: DOKEBI WORLD: A Korean Music Picnic
DESCRIPTION:Step into DOKEBI WORLD\, a K-Music Picnic where traditional K
 orean sounds meet contemporary music in a playful\, theme-park-inspired a
 tmosphere!\n\nToronto-based Korean fusion band DOKEBI invites you to thei
 r debut concert for an afternoon filled with live music\, food\, drinks\,
  and fun. Blending Korean traditional rhythms and sounds with guitar\, pi
 ano\, flute\, vocals\, and modern musical influences\, DOKEBI creates a f
 resh sound that is both rooted in Korean culture and made for today.\n\nW
 hether you already love Korean music or are discovering it for the first 
 time\, DOKEBI WORLD is designed to be an easygoing and welcoming experien
 ce for everyone.\n\nCome with friends or family\, grab some food and drin
 ks\, and enjoy a different kind of Saturday afternoon concert. Bring your
  own picnic blanket\, get cozy\, and enjoy the music 🧺\n\n📅 Saturday\, 
 September 5\, 2026 at 3 PM\n📍 Downsview Church — 4110 Chesswood Dr.\, To
 ronto\n🎟️ Advance: $20 | Door: $25\n\nWelcome to DOKEBI WORLD — your K-M
 usic Picnic starts here!\n\nGet your tickets here:\nhttps://www.zeffy.com
 /en-CA/ticketing/dokebi-world https://www.zeffy.com/en-CA/ticketing/dokeb
 i-world
