BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Wildernessunion": "https://www.meetup.com/wildernessunion/events/315994056/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_wildernessunion
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Wilderness Union
UID:event_315994056@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T042026Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260906T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260906T160000
SUMMARY:Forks of the Credit Summertime Trek
DESCRIPTION:Wilderness Union Toronto - Outdoor Adventure and Hiking Club\n
 **Please note the only way to register for this adventure is on [our websi
 te.](https://www.wildernessunion.com/adventures/fforks-of-the-credit)**\n\
 n**Ten kilometers\, one river\, and about 300 metres of elevation gain pac
 ked into a single Caledon loop.**\n\nWe start near Kettle Lake\, a small g
 lacial pond that gives this section of the park its name\, and follow the 
 Meadow Trail as it dips down toward the water before climbing back out thr
 ough mixed forest. From there we pick up the Bruce Trail along an open rid
 ge\, where the ground flattens out and the Credit River valley opens up be
 low.\n\nThe second half of the loop is where the park earns its name. We d
 rop down toward the ruins of a former hydro power station\, its concrete f
 oundations still standing next to the river\, before a short detour to the
  viewing platform for Cataract Falls. It is not a thundering waterfall\, b
 ut the setting\, tucked into the escarpment with the old ruins for company
 \, is worth the stop.\n\nThe final stretch follows the river home\, easy a
 nd flat\, the escarpment behind you and the Credit River keeping you compa
 ny the rest of the way.\n\n**Highlights**\n**Kettle Lake:** A glacial pond
  formed over 10\,000 years ago\, ringed by the lumpy\, uneven ground left 
 behind by melting ice.\n**Cataract Falls and the Ruins:** A quiet waterfal
 l next to the crumbling remains of a 19th century power station.\n**Escarp
 ment Ridge Views:** An open stretch of the Bruce Trail with sightlines dow
 n into the Credit River valley.\n\n**Event cost: $50+HST (for explorer mem
 bers) - $40 optional transport available.**\n**Register [here.](https://ww
 w.wildernessunion.com/adventures/fforks-of-the-credit)**\n\n**About Wilder
 ness Union**\nWilderness Union is deliberate about building an outdoors co
 mmunity that connects you to the life-changing magic of the outdoors and h
 elps you find your people.\n\nMembers range from 20-40 years old. The grou
 p is a mix of GTA locals and newcomers to Toronto from within Canada and a
 broad.\n\nAttendance numbers on Meetup don't reflect our actual event atte
 ndance - we typically have 15-20 community members at each event. Large en
 ough that there's someone new to meet but small enough that it's not overw
 helming!\n\n***Learn more at our website [www.wildernessunion.com](https:/
 /www.wildernessunion.com/)***
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/wildernessunion/events/315994056/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260805T212016Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260805T212016Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
