BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Tool Library": "https://ttlmarket.com/products/woodworking-level-2-sept-8-tuesdays-6-week-comprehensive"}
X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_tool_library
SUMMARY:Woodworking Level 2 Sept 8 [Tuesdays - 6 week Comprehensive]
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T130000
UID:ttl-11048158396609@ttlmarket.com
DESCRIPTION:Woodworking Level 2 at TTLMakerspace\n\n \n \n Note: This cour
 se requires previous completion of Intro to Woodworking\n\n In this course
  at TTLMakerspace\, you will use and expand upon the skills learned in Int
 ro Woodworking. Working in a small group with dedicated instructor\, you'l
 l expand your skills in two practical box-building projects designed to de
 velop deeper understanding of woodworking.\n\n In this followup to Woodwor
 king Intro students advance their skills into more sophisticated use of bo
 th power tools and hand tools. During the course two projects are created 
 that reveal techniques for creating mitred joints\, splines\, inlays\, lap
  joints\, and finishing techniques.\n\n Build up confidence in the shop an
 d learn new\, valuable woodworking techniques.\n\n \n Materials and equipm
 ent for all projects are provided with the course. \n\n Schedule : \n\n Si
 x three-hour weekly classes\, Tuesdays 10am to 1pm. \n\n Outcomes : \n\n A
 t the end of this course you will have achieved the following goals: \n\n 
 \n- Become more comfortable milling rough lumber \n\n- Complete mitered co
 rners \n\n- Complete box joints \n\n- Use a spline jig \n\n- Complete inla
 ys \n\n- Install hinges \n\n- Apply finishes \n\n- Learn how to plan proje
 cts efficiently with minimal waste \n\n \n Following this course\, you'll 
 be certified to use the woodshop. And you'll be able to join the growing c
 ommunity of TTL Makers sharing knowledge on our Discord community.\n\nUsef
 ul for: furniture\, cabinets\, organisers\, cutting-boards \n \n \n \n Wan
 t to get notified next time classes are posted? \n\n Join our mailing list
 !
LOCATION:TTLMakerspace\, 192 Spadina Ave.\, Toronto\, ON
URL:https://ttlmarket.com/products/woodworking-level-2-sept-8-tuesdays-6-w
 eek-comprehensive
X-SOURCE:Toronto Tool Library
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Torontobotanicalgarden": "https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/event/keep-fit-in-fall-4-sessions-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:torontobotanicalgarden
X-SOURCE:Toronto Botanical Garden
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T110000
DTSTAMP:20260905T002112
CREATED:20260810T204209Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260811T180007Z
UID:10002012-1788861600-1790679600@torontobotanicalgarden.ca
SUMMARY:Keep Fit in Fall (4 sessions)
DESCRIPTION:Move easily this fall and keep fit!\nGet your body moving and feeling good! This class combines gentle\, full-body exercises that boost your balance\, agility\, strength\, and posture—all while helping prevent pain\, stiffness\, and falls. With a mix of stretching\, light weights\, and mindful movement\, you’ll leave feeling stronger\, looser\, and more energized. It’s an hour of movement that’s as fun as it is good for you.\n \nTuesdays\, September 8 through 29\, 10 to 11 a.m (4 sessions).\n \nPublic $60\, TBG Member $48 (plus applicable taxes and fees)\n \nPlease note that this session will take place in the Upstairs Studios.\n \nIf you are interested in a trial class\, please get in touch with programsupport@torontobotanicalgarden.ca for more information.\n \nAbout Tena van Andel\nTena van Andel is a certified Level II 3-D Workout™ instructor who wants to keep all of us moving till we’re 102. She enjoys volunteering for the Toronto Master Gardeners and is busy rewilding a 19th-century rundown farmhouse\, fondly referred to as her ‘estate’.\n \nJoin Toronto Botanical Garden\nJoin the Toronto Botanical Garden (TBG) as a member to get a discount on this program\, upcoming events and classes\, and free parking. A TBG membership helps you deepen your knowledge and connection to the natural world\, become a part of a dynamic community of plant people\, and be inspired! Become a member!\n \nAdditional Program Information\n\n\n\nPlease review our Refund Policy and Terms of Agreement.\nFor more information on accessibility at the garden please review our Accessibility Features webpage. If you have any accessibility requirements during your program please email programsupport@torontobotanicalgarden.ca.\nTo learn more about the Toronto Botanical Garden and our programs\, please review our list of Frequently Asked Questions.
URL:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/event/keep-fit-in-fall-4-sessions-2/
LOCATION:Toronto Botanical Garden\, 777 Lawrence Avenue East\, Toronto\, ON\, M3C 1P2\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontobotanicalgarden.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/0df13ad5af2b147b31cd3cfc19612302.jpg
END:VEVENT
