X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_microsoft_reactor_toronto
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Microsoft Reactor Toronto
UID:event_315725415@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T042012Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T140000
SUMMARY:CoreStory + GitHub Copilot: Turning Plausible Suggestions Into Cor
 rect Ones
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nGitHub Copilot is powerful\, but it
 s effectiveness depends on context. By connecting CoreStory to Copilot thr
 ough MCP\, developers give Copilot persistent intelligence about their cod
 ebase\, architecture\, dependencies\, and business logic.\nThe result: mor
 e accurate suggestions\, fewer hallucinations\, fewer regressions\, and co
 de that works the first time.\nJoin us for a live demo showing how CoreSto
 ry helps Copilot deliver smarter\, more trustworthy results\, and why team
 s have seen up to 44% better task resolution when AI agents work from Core
 Story’s intelligence.\n\nSeries Info - https://aka.ms/StartupSpotlight/S
 -1443\n\n[EventID:27459]
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3157
 25415/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260717T181429Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260717T181429Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Toronto Postgres": "https://www.meetup.com/toronto-postgres/events/316166540/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_toronto_postgres
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto Postgres
UID:event_316166540@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T042022Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260908T140000
SUMMARY:AI Fatigue\, The pros\, Cons and How do we prepare for more of it
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Postgres\nWe've all seen a little too much AI in Linke
 dIn posts\; AI slop has even become a new classification option on LinkedI
 n.\nAI is an amazing tool to make things in your life better\, but it has 
 serious consequences and problems.\nThis talk will show some of the good t
 hings\, bad things\, and how we should move forward to improve human conne
 ction in the future.\nIf you have felt a little overwhelmed recently with 
 AI in your world come join us for a great discussion on things you can do 
 to feel better.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-postgres/events/316166540/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260818T125121Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260818T125121Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
