SUMMARY: Youth Climate Corps Fall National Call: SEP 8  - by Good Green
  Jobs For All
LOCATION:Virtual
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://actionnetwork.org/events/ycc-sep8-national-call/\n\nHosted by
  Good Green Jobs For All (https://goodgreenjobsforall.ca)\n\nJoin this
  national call to hear about a campaign to win a permanent\, large-scale
  Youth Climate Corps—funded at a minimum of $1 billion per year.
  Together\, we can generate the power\, excitement\, and community support
  needed to turn this vision into reality.
