UID:TKF/6755f42da02aaf1c2599e7ae/21881/29815260/0/0
DTSTART:20260909T010000Z
DTEND:20260909T030000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/torevent/detail/21881/1788915600000
SUMMARY: Ehsan Sadigh’s Septet IV/IX — Comprovisation by Rondo Projects
DESCRIPTION:Dear Toronto friends!\n\nThis will be the last performance in
  the Septet IV/IX Toronto series.\n\nWe are excited to present the final 
 part of Ehsan Sadigh’s Septet IV/IX — Comprovisation (Composition + Impro
 visation) by Rondo Projects. Join us as a quartet!\n\nFeaturing:\n\nBea L
 abikova — baritone & alto saxophones\n\nChris Pruden — keys / synth bass\
 n\nDhaivat Jani — drums\n\nEhsan Sadigh — guitar\n\n\nTuesday\, September
  8th\n\n9:00 PM\n\nThe Tranzac Club (Southern Cross)\n\nPWYC (Pay What Yo
 u Can)\n\n\nFor more details\, check out the Tranzac Club website. Hope t
 o see you there!\n\n\n———\n\n\nThe idea behind Septet IV/IX was originall
 y conceived by Ehsan Sadigh for a chamber ensemble and was planned to be 
 performed in Tehran\, with a flexible lineup of 7 to 12 musicians. Althou
 gh geopolitical conflicts have temporarily put those plans on hold\, the 
 project has now taken shape in Toronto as a dynamic four-stage series\, i
 n which both the composition and the number of performers change and deve
 lop from one stage to the next\, moving through duo\, trio\, and quartet 
 configurations.\n\n\nFeaturing musicians from Toronto and Montreal\, this
  initiative is a core part of Ehsan Sadigh’s Rondo Projects. The Toronto 
 series began in a trio format\, and this final performance features Bea L
 abikova\, Dhaivat Jani\, and Chris Pruden alongside Ehsan Sadigh.\n\nSept
 et IV/IX is planned to be performed in Tehran in late 2026 or early 2027\
 , in the Rondo Projects format\, featuring leading local musicians.\n\n\n
 For more information about Ehsan Sadigh and his projects\, visit his offi
 cial website and social media channels.\n\nehsansadigh.carrd.co/ https://
 ehsansadigh.carrd.co/\n\nwww.quartetdiminished.com/ https://www.quartetdi
 minished.com/\n\nehsansadigh.bandcamp.com/ https://ehsansadigh.bandcamp.c
 om/
CATEGORIES:Concert,Tranzac
