  phone\, the operating system\, the home page and how to use Wi-Fi and Cel
 lular Data. We will practice skills such as taking a picture\, scanning a
  QR code\, and sending a text. No prior expertise in cell phone use is req
 uired to take this class.\nRegistration is Required.\nInformation Collecti
