DESCRIPTION:Address:\nBrainStation\nLocated at The Well\, next to the Indi
 go. Enter through Quantum Coffee\, then follow the signs to the elevators.
  Take the elevator to the 2nd floor.\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\n[Note: Drink
 s are not included with the event ticket but can be purchased at the bar. 
 ]\nAre you passionate about fintech? Do you find yourself talking about di
 gital wallets at parties or secretly hoping someone brings up blockchain o
 ver coffee? Or maybe you want to meet some friendly faces who get just as 
 excited about innovation in the financial space as you do. If any of that 
 sounds like you\, we’ve got the perfect event.\n🎊  Come hang out at F
 intech Social 🎊.\nThis isn’t your typical formal networking event\; w
 e’re all about good vibes\, great conversations\, and connecting with pe
 ople who are…\n\nHosted by Lorenze Dsouza & 4 others
LOCATION:BrainStation\, 482 Front St W 2nd floor\, Toronto\, ON M5V 0W1\, 
 Canada
URL:https://luma.com/qelgugk4
