X-SOURCE-ID:luma_toronto_discover
SUMMARY:Toronto Book Launch for "The Campfire Method"
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260909T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260909T193000
UID:evt-No8uFukfHqTnoPl@events.lu.ma
DESCRIPTION:Address:\nMentimeter North America Inc\nSomeone will buzz you 
 up in the elevator\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nJoin me in Toronto to launch 
 “The Campfire Method”\nCome experience what warming up a room without 
 awkward icebreakers actually feels like.\n\nABOUT THE EVENT\nThis is not a
  book reading.\nIt’s an intentionally designed experience.\nMost book la
 unches are a reading and a Q&A. This one isn’t\, mostly because it would
  make no sense.\nThe Campfire Method is about designing genuine connection
  in a group\, so I’m going to do that rather than describe it. You’ll 
 walk in\, and within a few minutes you find yourself in conversation with 
 a like-minded person. Not through forced fun. Not through a round of two
 …\n\nHosted by Jan Keck
LOCATION:Mentimeter North America Inc\, 500 King St W\, Toronto\, ON M5V 1
 L8\, Canada
URL:https://luma.com/do33l36g
X-SOURCE:Luma Toronto Discover
END:VEVENT
