SUMMARY: Playbills and Pasties: Where Broadway Gets Naughty. Burlesque an
 d Drag Cabaret for Theatre Lovers + post-show karaoke!
DESCRIPTION:A Broadway-themed cabaret show featuring award-winning burles
 que and drag performers.\n\nGet ready for an unforgettable evening of sho
 w-stopping performances and Broadway magic at our new\, bigger venue! ✨\n
 \nJoin us at Rosario’s https://maps.app.goo.gl/9d99cJku7RbKRbwA6 in The J
 unction on September 10th for Playbills and Pasties\, where the stage com
 es alive with dazzling dancers\, captivating vocalists\, and hilarious an
 tics. This one-of-a-kind cabaret show blends the glamour of Broadway with
  the art of the tease\, featuring an extraordinary cast of award-winning 
 burlesque and drag performers paired with live singers.\n\n\n🌮 Tacos\, M
 argaritas & Dinner!\n\nWe are so excited to bring the show to Rosario's! 
 Enjoy incredible Mexican food—from delicious tacos to amazing margaritas—
 right at your table during the show\, or come early to sit down for dinne
 r before the lights go down! Check out the menu here https://www.rosarios
 mexican.ca/food-menu .\n\n\n🎤 Post-Show Broadway Karaoke Party!\n\nThe f
 un doesn't end when the curtain falls. Stick around after the performance
  for our Broadway Karaoke Party\, where you get to take the mic\, belt ou
 t your favorite showtunes\, and sing along with the cast and fellow theat
 re nerds!\n\n\n\nWhat to Expect:\n\n  * Top-Tier Talent: Award-winning an
 d up-and-coming Toronto burlesque and drag performers.\n  * Live Vocals: 
 Experience the magic of live singing as our movement artists perform alon
 gside talented vocalists from Toronto's musical theatre scene.\n  * Broad
 way with a Twist: Classic and modern showtunes reimagined through a campy
 \, sexy\, and theatrical lens.\n  * Post-Show Karaoke: Sing your heart ou
 t after the main event!\n\n\nTicket Info:\n\n  * Limited Early Bird Ticke
 ts: $25\n  * Regular Tickets: $30 Advance tickets are strongly recommende
 d—our shows sell out fast!\n\nDon't miss this ultimate night of tease\, t
 unes\, tacos\, and theatrical talent!
CATEGORIES:Dance---Performance---Theatre,Comedy,Karaoke,Rosario's
