SUMMARY:Friday Crafts - Origami!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260911T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260911T153000
UID:6a80b0612dac6e00371f4e62@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this Friday Crafts session we'll make some simple but beaut
 iful creations out of folded paper! Instructions and guidance will be prov
 ided to keep things from getting too difficult or confusing. Let's have lo
 ts of fun folding paper together!\nOther activities\, such as colouring a
 nd board games\, are always available at our Friday Crafts sessions. Come 
 have fun and meet some new people from your community!\nDrop in.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Small Meeting Room\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a80b0612dac6e00371f4e62
