SUMMARY:Seeds for Liberation - by East End Acts for Palestine
LOCATION:The Redwood Theatre
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://actionnetwork.org/ticketed_events/seeds-for-liberation-the-redwoo
 d-theatre-september-11\n\nHosted by East End Acts for Palestine
  (https://www.instagram.com/eastendacts/)\n\nA screening of Seeds of
  Liberation\, situating Palestinian liberation within a broader legacy of
  anti-imperialist and decolonial movements. Followed by an in-person panel
  discussion with director Matthew Solomon and other guests on how we can
  deepen the connections between anti-colonial liberation movements here
  and around the world. Please bring a donation for Community Fridges. 
END:VEVENT
