SUMMARY:Fast Friends🤝 Meet New People | Board Games + Themed Rounds | 2
 5-45
DESCRIPTION:Toronto 20's to 50's Singles Social (4000+)\nWant to meet new 
 people in Toronto but don't want to spend the evening wondering who to tal
 k to?\n\nFast Friends is a professionally hosted social experience where o
 ur host guides the conversations and rotations\, making it easy to meet a 
 variety of people — even if you're coming alone.\n\n🎟️ Book Early &
  Save: [https://toronto12thsept.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toronto12thsept.
 eventbrite.co.uk)\n\nEarly Bird: CAD $10 \\| Regular: $15 \\| Door: $20 ca
 sh\nAdvance tickets are cheaper and help us plan the right group size and 
 space for the best experience.\n\n🤝 What to Expect\n7:00 PM — Welcome
 \nMeet Kruttika\, grab a drink and settle in. Most guests come solo\, so w
 e'll help you get connected.\n\n7:30–8:30 PM — Hosted Fast Friends\nMe
 et a new person every few minutes through short\, guided conversations.\n
 ✨ Themed Connection Rounds\nWe'll add a few interactive rounds using our
  new QR-based conversation activities — fun prompts and challenges desig
 ned to help conversations flow\, uncover common interests and take you bey
 ond the usual small talk.\n\n8:30 PM onwards — Board Games & Socialising
  🎲\nStay for easy\, social board games\, grab another drink and reconne
 ct with the people you clicked with. Play\, chat or simply keep the evenin
 g going.\n\n❤️ Why You'll Love It\n✔️ Meet 20+ new people in one e
 vening\n✔️ Professionally hosted conversations and rotations\n✔️ I
 nteractive Themed Connection Rounds\n✔️ Most guests attend solo\n✔
 ️ Board games after Fast Friends\n✔️ Reserved area at Stout Irish Pu
 b\n✔️ Members from our 7 Toronto Meetup communities may attend\n✔️
  Designed for ages 25–45\n\n🎟️ Why Book in Advance?\nYour ticket he
 lps us plan the right space\, manage group size and create a comfortable\,
  well-organised experience for everyone.\nCome solo. We'll guide the exper
 ience. You make the connections. ❤️\n\nFor over 10 years\, Fast Friend
 s has been helping people build friendships through professionally hosted 
 social events in 30+ cities worldwide.
