DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCheck event page for more details.\n\nWhat if you co
 uld finally make exactly what you see in your head?\nRight in the middle o
 f TIFF\, MAGNIFIC brings together filmmakers\, creators\, and creative tec
 hnologists for an afternoon unlike anything else happening in Toronto this
  week.\nTo start\, a Magnific Original debuts here first. A work that coul
 dn't exist without AI...built frame by frame with total creative control\,
  and shown publicly for the very first time. Its creator\, Javi Lopez\, ta
 kes the stage to pull back the curtain on how it was made\, and what it to
 ok to make it his.\nThen\, a powerhouse panel: Retaining Creative Agency\,
  How…\n\nHosted by Mónica Giudici\, Will Selviz & Joe Finlayson
