DESCRIPTION:Chef Yumiko leads a hands-on workshop to make the popular Asia
 n beverage\, Brown Sugar Milk with Boba. Participants will learn to prepar
 e and use the classic ingredients including milk\, molasses and tapioca pe
 arls to make this visually pleasing and sweet drink. Chef Yumiko will also
  provide a brief history of Boba and why it's so popular globally.\nAll te
 ens are welcome! Drop-in\, no registration required\nThis program is part 
 of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after sch
 ool and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, 
 nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\n
 or call the branch to find out more.
