 ssumes you have a basic understanding of computer skills -- basically\, if
  you can use a word processor or surf the web\, you can learn Python!\nReg
 istration will start 2 weeks before this class\n. This program is hosted 
 on Zoom. The Zoom information and link will be shared over email.\nInforma
