SUMMARY:Earth's Greatest Enemy Screening - by Seniors for Climate Action
  Now
LOCATION:New Horizons Tower
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.codepink.org/egetoronto916\n\nHosted by
  Seniors for Climate Action Now
  (https://seniorsforclimateactionnow.org)\n\nJoin Seniors for Climate
  Action Now! (SCAN!) Climate and Militarism Working Group and New Horizons
  for Climate Action\, in partnership with CODEPINK\, for a screening of
  Earth’s Greatest Enemy\, a powerful antiwar documentary. The film
  examines the enormous environmental impact of the U.S. military—one of
  the world’s largest consumers of fossil fuels.
