UID:evt-Qr56HIk7Hbh56N3@events.lu.ma
DESCRIPTION:Address:\nThe Drake Hotel\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nA book club
  party for readers who want conversation\, connection\, over a few cocktai
 ls.\nWhat happens when book lovers leave the group chat and meet in real l
 ife?\nLit IRL is a cozy-but-lively book club party designed for readers wh
 o want more than silent reading time. Expect playful games\, short live re
 adings\, thoughtful conversation\, and a room full of people who love stor
 ies as much as you do.\nBring a book you love\, a passage you can’t stop
  thinking about\, or just your curiosity. Throughout the evening\, we’ll
  mix and mingle over drinks\, share favourite excerpts\, and explore the i
 deas\, themes\,…\n\nHosted by Fifth Edit TO
LOCATION:The Drake Hotel\, 1150 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6J 1J3\, Canada
