SUMMARY:Together For Nature Tour - by Ontario Nature
LOCATION:Knox Presbyterian Church
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.canadahelps.org/en/charities/ontario-nature/events/together-f
 or-nature-tour-toronto/\n\nHosted by Ontario Nature
  (https://ontarionature.org)\n\nThe Together for Nature Tour is an
  opportunity for Indigenous and non-Indigenous Peoples to come together to
  raise our voices for nature and all our relations through story and song.
  Hear from Okiniwak\, Here We Stand and Friends of the Attawapiskat
  River\, who are travelling from Northern Ontario to visit communities
  across Southern Ontario.
END:VEVENT
