UID:6a6a6015b44674e2601bbdbc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover Korean mother-of-pearl (najeonchilgi)\, a traditional
  decorative art with centuries of history. Through a short cultural introd
 uction and guided hands-on activity\, participants will create a small kee
 psake inspired by traditional motifs.\nThis beginner-friendly workshop enc
 ourages creativity\, cultural appreciation\, and mindful making. All mater
 ials will be provided.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth H
 ubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where
  helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered
