 s bag to paint instead! If you attended our\nAdult Arts & Crafts Night:
  Paint Your Own Tote Bag\nprogram in August and did not finish painti
 ng your tote bag\, please feel free to bring your bag to work on during t
 his event.\nPlease note:\nthis is a self-guided program with no formal ins
