SUMMARY:Fast Friends 🤝 Meet More People\, Make Real Connections | 25–
 45 | Board Games
DESCRIPTION:Toronto 20's to 50's Singles Social (4000+)\nWant to meet new 
 people in Toronto and actually have conversations with them?\n\nFast Frien
 ds is a professionally hosted social experience that makes connecting easy
 . Instead of arriving at a large social event and wondering who to approac
 h\, our host guides the conversations and rotations so you get to meet a v
 ariety of people throughout the evening.\n\nWe’re back at Stout Irish Pu
 b\, a popular Toronto Irish pub with a relaxed atmosphere\, craft beers\, 
 food and 50+ board games available to enjoy.\n\n🎟️ Book Early & Save:
  [https://toro19thsept.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toro19thsept.eventbrite.c
 o.uk)\nEarly Bird: CAD $10\nRegular: CAD $15\nAt the Door: CAD $20 cash\nY
 ou can pay securely online with any debit or credit card through PayPal 
 — no PayPal account required.\n*Advance tickets are cheaper and help us 
 plan the right group size and space for a better experience.*\n\n🤝 The 
 Fast Friends Experience\n7:00 PM — Welcome & Introductions\nMeet your ho
 st Kristabelle\, grab a drink and settle in. Coming alone? Perfect — mos
 t guests do\, and we'll help you feel comfortable from the start.\n7:30–
 8:30 PM — Hosted Fast Friends\nMeet a new person every few minutes throu
 gh short\, guided conversations. Your host keeps the rounds moving\, so yo
 u don't have to worry about who to approach or what to do next.\n✨ Theme
 d Connection Rounds\nWe'll add interactive prompts and activities designed
  to help you discover shared interests — from travel and food to music\,
  fitness\, books\, hiking and more.\n🎲 From 8:30 PM — Board Games & S
 ocialising\nOnce you've met everyone\, stay and keep the evening going. Ch
 oose from Stout's selection of 50+ board games\, grab another drink and re
 connect with the people you clicked with.\n\n❤️ Why You'll Love It\n
 ✔️ Meet 20+ new people in one evening\n✔️ Professionally hosted co
 nversations and rotations\n✔️ Interactive Themed Connection Rounds\n
 ✔️ Most guests attend solo\n✔️ 50+ board games to enjoy afterwards
 \n✔️ Relaxed Irish pub atmosphere\n✔️ Members from our 7 Toronto M
 eetup communities may also attend\n✔️ Reserved space for our group\n
 ✔️ Designed for ladies and gents aged 25–45\n\n📍 Good to Know\n\n
 * Stout Irish Pub (221 Carlton St\, Toronto)\n* Most guests come alone\, s
 o you definitely won't be the only one arriving solo.\n* Our Toronto Fast 
 Friends events regularly bring together 30+ attendees\, with members joini
 ng from our other Toronto Meetup communities\, giving you plenty of people
  to meet.\n\nThis is a friendship and social event\, not a dating event. T
 he focus is on genuine conversations\, new friendships and expanding your 
 social circle.\nCome solo. We'll guide the experience. You make the connec
 tions. ❤️\n\nFor over 10 years\, Fast Friends has been bringing people
  together through professionally hosted social events in 30+ cities worldw
 ide.
