UID:6a7ce888386764026a16c6ca@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy some light refreshments\, and informal discussion about 
 services in the neighbourhood. Get to know your local library staff and le
 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nEach month we will be joined by a different 
 community organization. For this September event we are welcoming our\nFin
 ancial Empowerment\nstaff to introduce themselves and the free services th
 ey offer our community\, including filing taxes\, finding government benef
 its\, and handling debt.\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all par
 ticipants. Ingredient lists will be available at the program.
