DESCRIPTION:Giant Connect 4? Catan? Join fellow graduate peers in friendly\, competitive games!  \nMeet other graduate peers at the Faculty of Applied Science & Engineering over pizza and fun board games.  \nIn collaboration with MoveU\, the ISTEP invites you to an afternoon of pizza and games.  You are welcome to bring your games as well!  \nRegister in advance.  
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/grad-games-2/
CATEGORIES:Socials
END:VEVENT
