DESCRIPTION:Gain confidence in practicing your English-speaking skills\nEx
 pand your networking list and connect with new friends\nEnhance your Knowl
 edge about Canadian life and culture\nLet's Talk Time is an in-person prog
 ram.\nFor registration and further information contact Faiza E. 416-268-3
 981 or fesho@rexdalewomen.org\nIn partnership with Immigration\, Refugee
 s and Citizenship Canada\, Rexdale Women's Centre & Toronto Public Librar
 y.
