SUMMARY:Fuckup Nights Toronto: September 22
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260922T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260922T223000
UID:evt-OmGqpM3EDQQpvRP@events.lu.ma
DESCRIPTION:Address:\nclubhouse @ STACKT market\nToronto\, Ontario\nCanada
 \n\nWTF is Fuckup Nights?\nFailure is a part of any success story\, but we
  don't talk about it enough. We've all been to plenty of events where peop
 le tell you how they hacked\, hustled\, and created their success\, but ve
 ry few where someone gets up and says "I totally messed up\, and this is w
 hat you can learn from it."\nFuckup Nights Toronto is part of a global spe
 aker series where stories of failed businesses and projects are shared. Ea
 ch speaker is given 10 minutes and is able to use 10 images. After each sp
 eaker\, there’s a Q&A session\, as well as time for mingling and drinks!
 \nAgenda:\n6:30 - 7:15…\n\nHosted by Fuckup Nights Toronto Team\, Marsha
  Druker & Simba @flo100
LOCATION:clubhouse @ STACKT market\, 28 Bathurst St\, Toronto\, ON M5V 0C6
 \, Canada
URL:https://luma.com/funtosept22
X-SOURCE:Luma Toronto Discover
