 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, play games\, try out our
  robotics\, meet other kids and have fun! For ages 6-12. Drop-in.\nSnacks 
 are offered during the After School Club for participants.\nIf you or your
  child lives with a disability\, and requires an accessibility accommodati
 on to participate in this program\, please contact Accessibility Services 
 by email\, accessibleservices@tpl.ca\, or voicemail\, 416-393-7099\, to ma
 ke a request. Please contact us at least three weeks in advance.
