DESCRIPTION:Pawsitively Pets is a hands-on animal education program for te
 ens. The wonderful animal team is made up of an assortment of rescued pets
  that have found their forever home with them. Their goal is to provide th
 e animal team with a permanent home and the best possible care\, while sha
 ring their love of animals with others. All programs focus on responsible 
 pet ownership\, and the life-long commitment of owning a pet.\nThis progra
 m is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens
  after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available
 . Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nY
