DESCRIPTION:Are you interested in soccer and what this sport can do for yo
 u? Join us for a 1 hour engaging session with coach and athlete Pepy Malo
 nga of FOOT-IQ as he shares essential life skills such as leadership\, tea
 mwork\, communication\, and decision-making in a fun and relatable way thr
 ough soccer and sports.\nThrough interactive games\, real-life examples\, 
 and discussion\, participants will connect their love of sport to valuable
  tools for life success on and off the field.\nAll teens are welcome! Drop
 -in\, no registration required.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service
 . Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summe
