DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCheck event page for more details.\n\nA short\, off-
 the-record session on what’s really happening in content and influencer 
 marketing.\nOff The Record returns for a second edition\, bringing togethe
 r a larger curated group of creators\, brands\, and marketers for a candid
 \, discussion-led evening about the realities of content and influencer ma
 rketing in Toronto.\nUsing an unconference format\, the agenda is built li
 ve in the room. You submit the questions you want answered on-site\, the N
 arcity team selects the most relevant ones\, and small groups form around 
 each topic and niche. Whoever submitted the question helps moderate the…
 \n\nHosted by Chuck Lapointe & 5 others
