 November and continuing to mid-December. As usual\, we will have a walk ev
 ery Sunday\, starting at 10:00 AM. We also may offer some walks on weekday
 s this fall\, if there is enough interest. We will also offer our less for
 mal program of Winter City Walks\, from the beginning of January until it 
 is nice enough to cycle in the spring\, where the start points\, end point
 s\, and routes will typically not be announced until a fe...
