DESCRIPTION:This 6-week program helps individuals living with chronic pain
  learn skills that can help them better manage their chronic pain symptom
 s as well as their daily lives. Facilitated in partnership with The Neighb
 ourhood Organization and South Riverdale Community Health Centre. This pro
 gram will be conducted in Mandarin. For more information or to register p
 lease contact Sarah at (647) 296-0839.\nThe Neighbourhood Organization is
  solely responsible for the protection of personal information collected t
 hrough the program registration process.
LOCATION:Parliament Street
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7f34c7a821f90037edc7ad
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
