SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Backyard Birds Through the Seasons
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260924T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260924T173000
UID:6a6a699db44674e2601bbfb4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:It’s always a good day to observe birds in your garden\, fro
 m the snowy depths of winter to the height of summer bloom. In this progr
 am presented by the Toronto and Region Conservation Authority\, learn abou
 t common nesting\, wintering\, and migratory birds in the Greater Toronto 
 Area\, and how to attract\, feed\, and observe them throughout the season
 s!\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming 
 place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are a
 lways available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a b
