DESCRIPTION:Please note this program has been changed from Python III to P
 ython II. Python I was canceled on September 3 and is rescheduled for Sept
 ember 10. Python II will be rescheduled for September 24\, when Python III
  was supposed to take place. Python III will be rescheduled at a later dat
 e. Please check our website or call 416-393-7007 if you have questions.\nP
 ython is an open source programming language that is used for creating web
  applications\, web content\, mathematics and system scripting. In this fo
 llow up course we will expand our knowledge and skills with this programmi
 ng language.\nRegistration will start one week before this class. Compute
 rs will be provided.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informa
 tion on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Pub
 lic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information wi
