SUMMARY:North York Central Library Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260924T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260924T201500
UID:69f603ae596674bcd583e837@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop-in on the last Thursday of the month for a lively book d
 iscussion led by a librarian!\nRegular and Large Print copies of Septembe
 r's selection\,\nAll's Well\nby Mona Awad\, are now available to pick up f
 rom the first floor reference desk.\nThis title is also available as an eB
 ook\, as an eAudiobook\, as an Audiobook on CD\, and in Large Print.\nUpco
 ming Titles:\nSeptember 24 - All's Well by Mona Awad\nOctober 29 - To Be A
 nnounced\nNovember 26 - The Lion Women of Tehran by Marjan Kamali\nJanuary
  28 - To Be Announced\nFebruary 25 - Encampment by Maggie Helwig\nMarch 25
  - The Tainted Cup by Robert Jackson Bennett
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 2/3\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f603ae596674bcd583e837
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
