SUMMARY:Staging Environmental Action: Rethinking Litter & Pollution in
  Scarborough - by Scarborough Environmental Association
LOCATION:The Hub - Mid Scarborough
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.eventbrite.com/e/staging-environmental-action-rethinking-litt
 er-pollution-in-scarborough-tickets-1998390723449\n\nHosted by Scarborough
  Environmental Association (https://www.scarbenv.ca/)\n\nHow do garbage\,
  litter\, and pollution affect Scarborough and our wellbeing? What does
  change look like and how can we come together to catalyze change? Let's
  explore environmental action through movement\, play\, and theatre.
END:VEVENT
