SUMMARY:On Our Own Terms: Femme life and culture in Toronto - by The
  ArQuives
LOCATION:The Arquives
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://arquives.ca/event/on-our-own-terms/\n\nHosted by The ArQuives
  (https://arquives.ca)\n\nThe opening reception for the new On Our Own
  Terms exhibit\, highlighting the proliferation of queer and trans femme
  politics and culture in 1990s Toronto through archival materials and
  close to 50 oral history interviews with 24 queer and trans femme
  narrators. The exhibit runs Sept 24-Oct 18.
END:VEVENT
