 ssible to ride on this downhill spot because we will be walking on the sho
 ulder against the traffic. This unusual ride\, normally on a Sunday\, will
  be on Saturday in order to more easily navigate the TTC and the GO Train 
 schedules. We take the Niagara Train from Union Sta...
