DESCRIPTION:Learn practical strategies to keep your personal information s
 afe online. This session covers essential digital privacy habits\, creatin
 g and managing strong passwords\, recognizing common online threats such a
 s phishing\, malware\, and hacking. Gain the knowledge and confidence to m
 ake safer choices online.\nRegister online. Drop-ins welcome if space is a
 vailable.
