DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T143000
UID:6a999cb060ccaf01c0231d2d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a community screening of\nWaaPaKe (Tomorrow/Demain
 )\n\, a powerful 2023 documentary by Dr. Jules Arita Koostachin. The film 
 shares personal stories and explores the lasting impacts of residential sc
 hools\, while also looking toward healing\, hope\, and the future. Come wa
 tch\, reflect\, and share in this meaningful experience.
LOCATION:Northern District\, Rm 200\, 2nd floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a999cb060ccaf01c0231d2d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
