DESCRIPTION:Join artist Alysha Rocca in this workshop\, which involves use
  of needles and thread and learning the basics of hand-sewing. Monsters pr
 e-date the written word\, making storytelling and visual language crucial 
 to the development of sharing history. In this workshop\, we will delve in
 to creative expression and storytelling as we build a Monster Plushie toge
 ther. Through guided instructions and with donated fabrics\, teens will le
 arn the basics of sewing and pattern making.\nThis program is part of Yout
 h Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and
  in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutriti
 ous snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call
