SUMMARY:Annual General Meeting 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260928T203000
UID:389e6041bdead887f12f262663431706@jccc.on.ca
DESCRIPTION:Members of the Japanese Canadian Cultural Centre are invited t
 o attend the Annual General Meeting on Monday\, September 28\, 2026 at 7:3
 0 pm at the JCCC\, 6 Sakura Way\, Toronto\, Ontario M3C 1Z5. AGENDA 1) App
 rove Minutes of AGM – September 22\, 2026 Sharon Marubashi 2) Report fro
 m the Finance Chair Linda Ono 3) Appointment of Auditor for the ensuing ye
 ar Linda Ono 4) Appreciation to Retiring Board Members Chris Hope 5) Appro
 ve Nominations to the Board Sharon Marubashi 6) Approval of By-Law changes
  (see 2nd page of the form) Sharon Marubashi 7) Message from the President
  Chris Hope 8) Close of Business Chris Hope 9) Presentation by Executive D
 irector Jon Nagamatsu Any member who is unable to attend in person may com
 plete a Proxy Form\, and submit it in-person or by e-mail. Physical copies
  of the Proxy Form are also available at the JCCC reception desk. AGM Prox
 y Form By order of the Board of Directors\, Sharon Marubashi\, Secretary F
 or any questions\, please contact JCCC Board Secretary Sharon Marubashi at
  sharon.marubashi@jccc.on.ca .
LOCATION:Japanese Canadian Cultural Centre
URL:https://jccc.on.ca/event/annual-general-meeting-2026
X-SOURCE:Japanese Canadian Cultural Centre
END:VEVENT
