X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_bicycling_network
SUMMARY:Tuesday Ravine Ride: Diagonal Lines-Finch West Subway (Keele & Fou
 r Winds Drive) to Old Mill
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260929T133000
UID:4c75a361db244dc107b8bbd4cbb67746@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:You MUST register in order to participate in this ride. This r
 ide will be open for registration for 6 days beginning on the Wednesday be
 fore the event. If you need to cancel your registration\, try to do so by 
 noon the day before the ride. If registration is full try the waitlist and
  check back regularly for possible cancellations. Remember: Have your tire
 s fully inflated\, wear your helmet and bring a spare inner tube for YOUR 
 bike. Description: A one-way route \, downhill overall that ends at The Ol
 d Mill. Some areas are industrial\, but the extensive Humber Valley is bea
 utiful. Start: 10:30 a.m. (Try to arrive at 10:15 AM\, to allow for subway
  delays\, bike problems\, etc.) Meet outside the FINC...
LOCATION:Keele and Four Winds Drive
URL:https://www.tbn.ca/event-6691976
X-SOURCE:Toronto Bicycling Network
END:VEVENT
