SUMMARY:AI Robot mBot2: Let's Move
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261006T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261006T190000
UID:6a92f70eaafa610029600577@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get your mBot2 moving! In this hands-on introduction to roboti
 cs\, learners discover how to control the robot and bring it to life using
  simple coding. A fun first step into programming\, movement\, and robotic
 s.  Students will learn about how to start a programming code\,  some o
 f the different code blocks and have some fun learning how to move their r
 obot and try and park their robot like a car.\nDetails: patrons aged 13+\,
   basic mouse and keyboarding skills required
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Multi-Purpose Room\, 1st Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a92f70eaafa610029600577
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
