SUMMARY:Runnymede Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261006T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261006T193000
UID:6a90998c3b6c71003e5bd77c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a lively discussion of Shehan Karunatilaka's\nThe 
 Seven Moons of Maali Almeida\nWinner of the 2022 Booker Prize\, this novel
  is a searing\, mordantly funny satire set amid the murderous mayhem of a 
 Sri Lanka beset by civil war.\nDrop-in.
LOCATION:Runnymede\, 2nd Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a90998c3b6c71003e5bd77c
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
