SUMMARY:Finding Recovery Through Exercise Skills and Hope (FRESH): Craft C
 ircle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T153000
UID:6a7a0b7acca66c2f00a99797@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This\n program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn
  new skills\, and \nhave fun. It involves peer-led group activities which 
 can include crafts\, games\,\n walking\, yoga\, and more. Meet new folks\
 , build social connections\, and tell us\n about programs and services you
  would like to see in the neighbourhood!\nJoin us and make some crafts! Ex
 press your creativity throw Diamond painting\, a relaxing\, mosaic-style c
 raft where tiny resin "diamonds" are placed on a numbered adhesive canvas 
 to create a sparkling image.\nDrop-in\, all are welcome. Call 416-393-7712
  for more info.\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all participants
 . Ingredient lists will be available at the program.\nThis program is in 
 collaboration with\nGerstein Crisis Centre's F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
LOCATION:Dufferin/St.Clair\, Earlscourt Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7a0b7acca66c2f00a99797
