UID:6a6bae83d23de82955c9a3dc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Shibori is a traditional Japanese tie-dye method that uses fol
 ding\, twisting\, stitching and binding\n.\nIt creates detailed indigo\, b
 lue and white patterns by stopping dye from soaking into parts of the clot
 h. Participants will create a beautiful scarf/sarong to take home and enjo
 y.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming 
 place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are a
 lways available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a b
 ranch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
