DESCRIPTION:At least 1 in 3 women and 1 in 5 men will suffer from a fragil
 ity fracture in their lifetime. Join a volunteer facilitator from\nOsteopo
 rosis Canada\nand learn how to improve your bone health and reduce your ri
 sk of osteoporosis and related fractures by exploring the following:\nWhat
  you need to know about bone health and osteoporosis\nThe risk of fracturi
 ng a bone\nHow to maintain healthy bones\nImpact of nutrition & physical a
 ctivity fall prevention\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal info
 rmation on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the 
 Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information
  will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evalu
 ation. Questions about how the library handles your information can be dir
