 . It is wheelchair accessible by elevator as well as wheelchair ramp.\nTor
 onto\, ON\nCanada\n\nHave you heard the term “GMO” and never given it 
 a second thought? Or have you wondered why there is so much debate about g
 enetically modified organisms?\nWell\, you’re in luck.\nJoin Quantum L
 eaps youth leaders Yasmeen Lopez and Isabella Ciaccia with researchers and
  experts as they unpack the science behind genetic modification and answer
  your biggest questions about food\, farming\, ethics\, and innovation!\nN
 o background in science is needed\, as this event is free and open to ever
 yone\, regardless of age or experience with the topic.\nEvent Details:\n
 📅 Date: Thursday\, October 8th\, 2026\n🕕 Time:…\n\nHosted by Isabe
 lla Ciaccia & Yasmeen L
