SUMMARY:Opera Revue: A Non-Snobby Introduction to Opera
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261008T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261008T200000
UID:6a63a0720d65ac360041f5f1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Think opera is only for tuxedos and tiny binoculars? Think aga
 in. Join Opera Revue for an entertaining introduction to opera—big voice
 s\, dramatic stories\, and absolutely no snobbery. Beginners\, skeptics\, 
 and opera lovers alike are welcome.
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, Beeton Hall (1st floor)
