DESCRIPTION:Join us on the second Friday of every month for a lively disc
 ussion about the selected book in a welcoming and friendly space.\nGet you
 r physical copy in-branch at the Information Desk or borrow an eBook/eAudi
 obook copy by downloading the Libby app.\nAugust:\nWarlight\nSeptember:\nB
 roken Country\nOctober:\nDetective Aunty\nNovember:\nThe Casino Shift\nDec
 ember: We'll talk about all the books we've read! Year in Review!
LOCATION:Highland Creek\, Meeting Room
