UID:e8c8f7bd9e483cee8e4eb9ade481d07f@tbn.ca
DESCRIPTION:The ride starts from the Finch TTC subway parking lot at Hendo
 n Ave. west of Yonge St. The route goes north\, using mostly quieter stree
 ts and trails via McNaughton Rd to Maple. There will be a coffee/washroom 
 break at Tim Hortons and return by a different route and part of the hydro
  corridor\, to Finch subway. Distance: about 35kms\, it should finish abou
 t 12:30 to 1:00pm. The ride will be at Urban Roller pace - for more detail
 s click here . RWGPS link to route: Click here To join the club rides\, yo
 u must be a member and register for the ride. For more information on vari
 ous types of membership\, follow this link = click here PLEASE REGISTER:
