 register after 8 am on the day of the ride bring a copy of the confirmatio
 n email\, either printed or electronic\, to show to the ride leader. Pleas
 e remember to bring (and wear) a helmet. This is an Urban Roller level rid
 e. If you are uncertain whether this level is appropriate to your riding l
 evel\, click here . For a more nuanced description...
