DESCRIPTION:This ride will be open for registration for 6 days beginning o
 n the Monday before the event. Remember: Have your tires fully inflated\, 
 wear your helmet and bring a spare inner tube for YOUR bike. For this Sund
 ay LW ride we will have a different starting place. We will start on Millw
 ood Rd. at June Rowlands Park. (corner of Millwood and Mt. Pleasant)...Nor
 th of Davisville Subway. We will follow the Beltline Trail and some quiet 
 residential streets. After\, enjoy the patio at the Bread and Butter resta
 urant on Mt.Pleasant (cabbage rolls\, goulash\, schnitzel\, pastries) Note
 : Be prepared for some loose gravel on the Beltline. Starting Point: June 
 Rowlands Park- Millwood Rd. and Mt. Pleasant...Nort...
