DESCRIPTION:Do you have questions about your tablet\, phone\, laptop\, ema
 il or an app? Do you need help with eBooks or other online library service
 s? Our staff are here to help.\nDrop-in\, no registration required.\n20 mi
 nute limit during high demand.\nLonger questions may be referred to a 1 h
 our book a librarian appointment.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe per
 sonal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library 
 under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The i
