SUMMARY:Boba Drink Making Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261016T154500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261016T163000
UID:6a7cc125be1482002986e316@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this 45 minute Workshop\, participants will learn how to pr
 epare a classic milk bubble tea\, including decorating and mixing techniqu
 es\, as well as the breakdown of core ingredients. A classic lidded cup an
 d straw will be provided to enjoy the boba as you go!\nFood allergy notice
 \n: Please be aware that food will be used in this program. Food products 
 used in this program may contain or may have come into contact with common
  allergens. (*Contains dairy\, sugar\, and caffeine)\nThis program is for\
 nTeens 13-17\n.\n*Registration Required.\nSpace is limited. Register onlin
 e or call 416-396-8872.\nRegistration opens October 1\, 2026\n* Special gu
 est for the Friday Teen Social program.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nT
 he personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Li
 brary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d).
  The information will only be used for event and program registration\, de
 livery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your inform
 ation can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-39
