UID:6a5f89329943bdf31ea078aa@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join a creative and safe environment for writers of all levels
 ! Bring your written work to share with your peers when you're ready\, and
  to support your fellow writers!\nWe meet on the first and third Mondays o
 f the month\, from 6:30-8:00 pm. Regular attendance is requested.\nRegistr
 ation and the waitlist are currently full. Contact the branch for more i
 nformation.
LOCATION:Northern District\, Room 200
