DESCRIPTION:Join instructor Tobi Asmoucha from Gallery 44 Centre for Conte
 mporary Photography for a hands-on digital photography workshop and lear
 n how to use the functions of the DSLR camera in Manual Mode. Compose visu
 ally sound images using a variety of approaches. Hear about photography’
 s history while discussing and sharing each other's work. The workshop wil
 l culminate with learning how to upload & edit your photos using an online
  software. DSLR cameras will be provided by Gallery 44.\nThis program is 
 for young adults (ages 18-24).\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe person
 al information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library und
 er the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The info
