SUMMARY:Communication Badge Cross Stitch
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261024T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261024T160000
UID:6a4d0003f29b560a065f03d8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Calling all Trekkies! Join us at the Merril Collection for an 
 introductory cross stitch workshop. Participants will channel their inner 
 Star Fleet alter ego as they stitch a communication badge. Enjoy our curre
 nt exhibit\,\nSet Phasers to Celebrate! 60 Years of Star Trek: A Merril Co
 llection Exhibit\n\, and learn a new skill. This workshop is designed for
  beginners with no sewing or cross stitch experience. All supplies will be
  provided.\nThis workshop will be offered on two different dates. Please o
 nly register for one.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal inform
 ation on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Pu
 blic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information w
 ill only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluat
 ion. Questions about how the library handles your information can be direc
 ted to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge
  Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Merril Collection Reading Room\, 3rd Floor.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a4d0003f29b560a065f03d8
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
