BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Post Apocalyptic Book Club Toronto Chapter": "https://www.meetup.com/post-apocalyptic-book-club-toronto-chapter/events/315774777/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_post_apocalyptic_book_club_toronto_chapter
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Post-Apocalyptic Book Club
UID:event_315774777@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260905T042013Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261026T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261026T203000
SUMMARY:Childhood's End by Arthur C. Clarke
DESCRIPTION:Post-Apocalyptic Book Club - Toronto Chapter\nThis time we'll 
 be reading *Childhood's End* by Arthur C Clarke. Here's the blurb:\n\nThe 
 Overlords appeared suddenly over every city—intellectually\, technologic
 ally\, and militarily superior to humankind. Benevolent\, they made few de
 mands: unify earth\, eliminate poverty\, and end war. With little rebellio
 n\, humankind agreed\, and a golden age began.\n\nBut at what cost? With t
 he advent of peace\, man ceases to strive for creative greatness\, and a m
 alaise settles over the human race. To those who resist\, it becomes evide
 nt that the Overlords have an agenda of their own. As civilization approac
 hes the crossroads\, will the Overlords spell the end for humankind . . . 
 or the beginning?\n\nThe book is available here:\n\nAmazon- Hardcover\, Pa
 perback\, eBook\, Audiobook:\nhttps://a.co/d/0eZeVgUd\n\nIndigo- Paperback
 :\nhttps://www.indigo.ca/products/childhoods-end?variant=46163574915249\n\
 nKobo- eBook:\nhttps://www.kobo.com/ca/en/ebook/childhood-s-end-7?sId=5201
 63aa-c060-4248-86af-2c164df50fb6&ssId=RxtwaKpaq26cozXPzWgY4&cPos=1\n\nToro
 nto Public Library:\nhttps://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/record/S234C509506\n
 \nLooking forward to seeing you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/post-apocalyptic-book-club-toronto-ch
 apter/events/315774777/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260721T135906Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260721T135906Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
