DESCRIPTION:Join us every month to discuss a variety of graphic novels\, c
 omics\, and manga!\nFor October we will be reading and discussing\nThe Kur
 osagi Corpse Delivery Service\nby Eiji Otsuka.\nPrint copies are available
  for hold at TPL.ca. E-book copies available on Hoopla through the library
  website\nThe Kurosagi Corpse Delivery Service\nThis program is hosted by 
 the Arts Department
