DESCRIPTION:Join us in-person to have great book club discussions each mon
 th! October's book is Lost Lady by Willa Cather. Pick up your book at the
  front desk! Registration is required and copies are limited. Please place
  a copy of the book on hold if our branch does not have an available copy.
 \nForest Hill will have limited copies of the month's title 6 weeks prior
  to the date of the book club.\nUpcoming Books:\nJune 25:\nEverything I ne
 ver told you about\nJuly/August: Break\nSeptember 24:\nBroken Country\nOc
 tober 29:\nLost Lady\nNovember 26:\nCrook Manifesto
