SUMMARY:After School Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261030T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261030T163000
UID:6a80ae1d3b6c71003e591412@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! For ages 6-12.\nSnacks are offered during the After School Club for 
 participants. Ingredient lists will be available. Snacks are generously su
 pported\, in part\, by donors.
LOCATION:Alderwood
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a80ae1d3b6c71003e591412
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
