DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261030T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261030T170000
UID:6a85d1764c610f0038955242@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in after school on Friday's to have fun with your frien
 ds\, meet new folks\, build connections\, and tell us about programs and 
 services you would like to see in the neighborhood!
