 y friendly movie!\nThis months' movie:\nGhostbusters Frozen Empire\nThe Sp
 engler family returns to where it all started\, the iconic New York City f
 irehouse\, to team up with the original Ghostbusters gang\, who have devel
 oped a top-secret research lab to take busting ghosts to the next level. B
 ut when the discovery of an ancient relic unleashes an evil force\, Ghostb
 usters new and old must join forces to protect their home and save the wor
 ld from a second Ice Age.
