DESCRIPTION:Join other book lovers in your community and participate in li
 vely discussions of popular books. This book club will meet every first Tu
 esday of the month for a lively discussion in a welcoming\, relaxed settin
 g. New members are always welcome and encouraged to join.\nSeptember 1\, 2
 026 -\nFriends\, Lovers\, and the Big Terrible Thing by Matthew Perry\nOct
 ober 6\, 2026 -\nThe Whispers by Ashley Audrain\nNovember 3\, 2026 -\nBlin
 dness by Jose Saramago\nCopies of the book are available for borrowing at 
 the Fairview Library.\nDrop-in\, no registration necessary.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a7258b7b3bdcec4a666b967
