SUMMARY:Throwback Thursdays: Great Movies on the Big Screen
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261105T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261105T200000
UID:6a8f67191c197d11325b1636@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a radical retro rewind projected on the big s
 creen. Whether you're a first-time viewer or long-time fan\, these movies 
 are sure to please.\nAugust 13: There’s Something About Mary (1998\, 14
 A)\nAugust 20: Speed (1994\, PG)\nAugust 27: You've Got Mail (1998\, PG)\
 nSeptember 3: Legally Blonde (2001\, PG)\nSeptember 10: Primal Fear (199
 6\, 18A)\nSeptember 17: Kramer vs Kramer (1979\, PG)\nSeptember 24: The Li
 ncoln Lawyer (2011\, 14A)\nAll are welcome. Drop-in\, no registration requ
 ired.
LOCATION:High Park\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a8f67191c197d11325b1636
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
