DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T173000
UID:6a3996b68ea300e2631f88a0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun after-school activity? Join our Youth Chess 
 Program to learn new skills\, play matches\, and connect with others!\nThi
 s program is open to youth ages 7-17 years old. Facilitated by the Univers
 ity of Toronto Scarborough Chess Club.\nNo registration required. Space is
  limited.
LOCATION:Port Union\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3996b68ea300e2631f88a0
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
