  AI Workshop and Meetup\, co-presented by Nebius and Voxel51\, hosted at t
 he Terrace Room\, University of Toronto.\nA laptop is required to particip
 ate in the hands-on workshop - please bring one. Space is limited\, so reg
 ister early.\nBy submitting\, you agree to Voxel51's Terms of Service and 
