UID:698bcd5c94297d3600ab6958@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a staff moderated discussion on mystery novels\, c
 rime fiction\, and whodunits.\nThis month's featured title is\nThe Last Th
 ing He Told Me\nby Laura Dave .\nThis program is hosted on Zoom. The Zoom 
 information and link will be shared over email.\nInformation Collection No
 tice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto P
 ublic Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, an
 d 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program registrat
 ion\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles you
 r information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\
 , 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.\n[Start with your 
 own unique description of the Book Club and use the 'Title' button to link
  to the title being discussed for the month]
