SUMMARY:Romance Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261112T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261112T193000
UID:6a972e65392e9c02993d47aa@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the Romance Book Club\, where love stories take cen
 ter stage and every page promises a new adventure of the heart. Whether yo
 u're into slow burns\, second chances\, or enemies-to-lovers\, there's som
 ething here for every kind of romantic. Come read\, swoon\, and share your
  favorite moments with fellow book lovers.\nThe Romance Book for the Thur
 sday November 12 meeting is\nFossil Feud\nby Maggie North\nPlease note th
 at this book club is for individuals 18+.\nDrop in\, no registration requi
 red.
LOCATION:City Hall
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a972e65392e9c02993d47aa
