UID:6a5e640a0ed7b4521ed694a7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop we will be using a variety of materials to cr
 eate holiday cards. Stamps\, stencils\, and watercolour paints are just a 
 few of the materials we will use to create a variety of different cards. W
 e will also explore creative lettering with lots of time for practice and 
 experimenting.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are 
 a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful
  staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily.
  Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
