SUMMARY:Youth Hub: House of Games Trivia
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261118T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261118T090000
UID:6a91cb58b2047800299641ed@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The temperature is cooling\, but the competition is heating up
 ! Join us for Morgan’s House of Games\, Ep. 31. Indulge your love of fun
  and facts with an exciting round of trivia that’ll test your general kn
 owledge\, lateral thinking\, and quick reflexes.\nThis is a Youth Hub prog
 ram for\nteens only\n.\nDrop-in attendance\, no registration required.\nTh
 is program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place 
 for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always 
 available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch 
 with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Don Mills\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a91cb58b2047800299641ed
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
