UID:6966a33339996c13d3cffed8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun and social game of BINGO designed for senior
 s! It’s a great way to stay mentally sharp and body active\, connecting 
 with others in a friendly\, relaxed atmosphere. Prizes\, laughter\, and go
 od company await!
LOCATION:Woodview Park\, Program Room
