SUMMARY:Calm and Colour - featuring a therapy dog
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261122T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261122T160000
UID:6a47b839541102b7fa8a2b92@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For adults seeking a soothing\, mindful escape from the stress
 es of daily life.\nWhether you're looking to unwind after a long day\, boo
 st your creativity\, or simply find a peaceful moment for yourself\, come 
 to our tranquil space for a coloring activity and to recharge.\nThis sessi
 on will feature\na therapy dog\nand\nhandler team\nfrom One Health Partner
 s. Participants will be invited to gently interact with the dog in small g
 roups of up to 5 people at a time.\nFeel free to bring your own coloring m
 aterials!\nRegistrants will need to check-in by 3:05 pm to hold their spot
 . Drop-ins welcome until capacity is reached.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 101\, ground floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a47b839541102b7fa8a2b92
