 rab a snack and work on your homework amongst friends!\nAll teens are welc
 ome! Drop-in\, no registration required.\nThis program is part of Youth Hu
 b service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in 
 the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious 
 snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the
  branch to find out more.
