SUMMARY:Scrabble Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261126T200000
UID:69483bb68d33cc4900c65bee@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy playing Scrabble? Want to meet others who do\, too? Join
  us every last Thursday of the month for Scrabble Night.
LOCATION:Eglinton Square\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69483bb68d33cc4900c65bee
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
