DESCRIPTION:​Learn the art and secrets of designing miniature Christmas 
 scenes inside a glass globe to create a unique ornament. Go home with a un
 ique piece ready to add to your Christmas tree\, home décor or give as a 
 gift. Unleash your creativity\, learn something new and discover your hidd
 en talents. All participants receive a curated craft kit from the instruct
 or.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form
  is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act
 \, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information  will only be use
 d for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions 
 about how the library handles your information can be directed to Answerl
